config BR2_PACKAGE_LVDSPAT
	bool "lvdspat"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	help
	  Paint a known test pattern on one display output through KMS.

	  The tester reads pixels back out of the FPGA by coordinate, so what
	  it needs on screen is a picture it already knows: a marker column,
	  a ramp, a solid fill. fbdev cannot do it - its one framebuffer is
	  cloned to every output - so this goes through KMS and can paint one
	  output while the others keep whatever they were showing.
